  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">FEP:BH-L1006 Programa de Desarrollo Juvenil</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEF:BH-L1006 Youth Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the proposed MAPPE is to support the start-up of the National Youth Program (BH-L1006). The specific objectives of the MAPPE are to: (i) finalize the design of the Program; (ii) strengthen the implementation capability of the Ministry of Youth Sports and Culture (MYSC) and other key youth service providers; and (iii) support the Government of The Bahamas with the evaluation, reformulation and implementation of its top priority pilot program with high-at-risk males and determine its eligibility for IDB financing.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
